= Engineering
#note[Design and Teambuilding]
== Get to know your kits
We'll be using these kits for two different challenges today.

Spend 5 minutes looking through the kit and working out what you have and how it links together.

You can use the 'disks' to hold the long pieces at different angles. Can you work out which ones you have available?
#place( dy:-2em, center,
  image("img/mecano-kit.png",height:80%)
)

== Challenge - Communications tower
You need to build a communications tower that holds a “satellite”
- The satellite is made of two disks held apart by a pole
- The minimum distance between the disks is 30cm
- The pole between the disks must be parallel to the floor
- The centre of the satellite must be a minimum of 1.2 m above the floor#pause
- The tower must be free standing and movable
- The tower must withstand strong winds
- As soon as you think you are done call me and I will check#pause
- First group to complete this - satisfying all the criteria above - wins

== Prepare Kit
Take your tower apart ready for the next challenge.
